  "notes": {
    "lyra": "The drum song (puzzles/drum-song.json, the tw-song cue): the band plays the pattern by hand and it wanders; the player pins it on the drum and the box plays it the same every time (07 · from-the-studio-programming-the-sequencer).",
    "agnes": "The four gears (tw-gears) frames the gears’ wall for the matching check (M7.1); then manual and local first (K7.2) and a good starter (K7.3).",
